{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-catchall-039-03", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/ScenarioAutoCommitResourcesAppliedTests.cs", "line": 325, "method": "AutoCommit_CommitOrderingIsCommitThenMark", "category": "T3", "severity": "Medium", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/ParsekScenario.cs:1164-1165; swapping the two calls -> stays green; deleting CommitPendingTree -> red", "what_it_asserts": "After the seam runs the pending slot is empty, the tree is committed and the index is advanced.", "why_weak": "The name and comment promise a reorder guard, but every assertion is end-state and the end state is order-independent, as the comment concedes.", "proposed_action": "Rename to an end-state test, or make the order observable (assert MarkTreeAsApplied sees HasPendingTree false, or pin the emitted log order).", "effort": "M", "july_ref": "none"}
